      "pageDescription": "We did; I shouted at least 4 questions that Hegseth did not answer, on whether he takes responsibility for the war; on war crimes; others shouted if he’d become a distraction for Trump. Hegseth only took Qs from\nConservative media or new media outlets they brought in after kicking out the Pentagon…",
      "evidenceText": "Tara Copp on X: \"We did; I shouted at least 4 questions that Hegseth did not answer, on whether he takes responsibility for the war; on war crimes; others shouted if he’d become a distraction for Trump. Hegseth only took Qs from Conservative media or new media outlets they brought in after kicking… / X Post Log in Sign up Post Log in Sign up Tara Copp on X: \"We did; I shouted at least 4 questions that Hegseth did not answer, on whether he takes responsibility for the war; on war crimes; others shouted if he’d become a distraction for Trump. Hegseth only took Qs from Conservative media or new media outlets they brought in after kicking out the Pentagon press corps last year. Almost everyone who got questions, save for our colleague Mike Glenn, had agreed to the strict rules that the Pentagon Press Corps refused to sign last year.\" Conversation Tara Copp @TaraCopp We did; I shouted at least 4 questions that Hegseth did not answer, on whether he takes responsibility for the war; on war crimes; others shouted if he’d become a distraction for Trump. Hegseth only took Qs from Conservative media or new media outlets they brought in after kicking out the Pentagon press corps last year. Almost everyone who got questions, save for our colleague Mike Glenn, had agreed to the strict rules that the Pentagon Press Corps refused to sign last year. Bo Berry @BoBerryBisc Nov 10 Replying to @TaraCopp and @MeidasTouch A good journalist would test them on this 3:23 PM · Nov 10, 2026 · 75.4K Views 270 235 858 27 Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Relevant people Tara Copp @ TaraCopp Follow @WashingtonPost Pentagon correspondent. Signal: taracopp.06. Email: [email protected] What’s happening Show more Tara Copp @TaraCopp We did; I shouted at least 4 questions that Hegseth did not answer, on whether he takes responsibility for the war;